cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the latest formal release."
title: "Alzheimer’s Choice Theory: Single-Origin Closed Causal Topological Model"
abstract: >
  A closed-causal theoretical framework proposing that the long-term Non-Thinking State (NT)
  is the sole upstream endogenous generative condition of Alzheimer’s disease. V1.1 Final Draft
  is a revision based on V1.0 Final Draft, preserving the same core logical structure, causal topology,
  principal mechanisms, and principal conclusions, while incorporating textual refinements,
  errata corrections, and clearer formulation of structural and falsifiability statements.
  The Chinese original is the authoritative source text; the English and mathematical versions
  are companion representational forms.
